	(text "EoS ATmega328P Board, rev A. Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava. Fits Uno R3 shields.\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nValues from Microchip DS40002061B and AN2519, WCH CH340 V3D, TI SLVSFG1A (TPS2116),\nTI SCES351Y and SCES296AG (buffers), Diodes DS41326 (AP63205) and DS39724 (AP2112),\nECS ECX-33Q (crystal, CL 12 pF -> 18 pF). Low fuse 0xFF (low-power crystal oscillator).\nJP1 (bridged as delivered) joins the DTR# auto-reset to RESET: cut it for debugWIRE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 380 0)
		(effects
			(font
